      "writtenOn": "2022-04-26T22:43:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason of this is the following:\n\n- Bazel requires the list of outputs to be listed\n- We also want to keep track of the list and ensure the change is deliberate.\n\nHence Matthias and I decide to ask developers to maintain this list, unlike in build.sh.\n\nCurrently, if the list is out-dated (e.g. a new module is built or a module is removed), a build error is raised when running the Bazel build.\n\nI am also going to add build test to postsubmit then presubmit. But it\u0027ll still need developers to update the list.\n\nStill, I think your point is absolutely valid. Filing Bug:230529320 to keep track of potentially removing this.",
